english:
I've put you down for *{service}* on *{when}* (West Africa Time).

Reference: #{ref}

If that time doesn't work, just say *"reschedule"* and I'll move it.

current_ig:
Edebela m gị *{service}* na *{when}* (oge Naịjịrịa).

Nọmba ntụaka: #{ref}

Ọ bụrụ na oge ahụ adịghị gị mma, kwuo *"reschedule"* ka m gbanwee ya.

english:
✅ Your booking for *{service}* has been successfully cancelled.

Reference: #{ref}

If you paid and would like a refund, please say *"I need a refund"* and I'll raise a request for you.

current_ig:
✅ Akagbuola m ndebanye gị maka *{service}*.

Nọmba ntụaka: #{ref}

Ọ bụrụ na ị kwụrụ ụgwọ ma chọọ nkwụghachi, kwuo *"I need a refund"* ka m debe ya.

english:
Here is what I have — please check it carefully before I register you:

• Name: {name}
• Age / DOB: {age}
• Address: {address}
• LGA: {lga}
• Plan: {plan}{free}
• Primary facility: {facility}
• NIN: {nin}

Is all of that correct? Reply *yes* to register, or tell me what to change.

current_ig:
Nke a bụ ihe m nwetara — biko lelee ya nke ọma tupu m debanye aha gị:

• Aha: {name}
• Afọ / Ụbọchị ọmụmụ: {age}
• Adreesị: {address}
• LGA: {lga}
• Atụmatụ: {plan}{free}
• Isi ebe ahụike: {facility}
• NIN: {nin}

Ihe niile ziri ezi? Zaa *yes* ka m debanye, ma ọ bụ gwa m ihe m ga-agbanwe.

english:
You have more than one coming up. Which would you like to {verb}?

{list}

Reply with the number.

current_ig:
Ị nwere ihe karịrị otu na-abịa. Kedu nke ị chọrọ {verb}?

{list}

Zaa site na nọmba.

english:
{heading}Here is what is free:

{list}

Reply with the number that suits you. If none of these work, say *"speak to an agent"* and a colleague will find something else.

current_ig:
{heading}Nke a bụ oge ndị nwere ohere:

{list}

Zaa site na nọmba dabara gị. Ọ bụrụ na ọ dịghị nke dabara, kwuo *"speak to an agent"*.

english:
I can only move it to one of these, so that I do not put you down for a time that is already taken:

{list}

Reply with the number, or say *"speak to an agent"* for anything else.

current_ig:
Enwere m ike ịkwaga ya naanị na otu n'ime ndị a, ka m ghara itinye gị n'oge e weerela:

{list}

Zaa site na nọmba, ma ọ bụ kwuo *"speak to an agent"*.

