english:
Just to confirm before I change anything:

• {label}
• From: {from}
• To: {to}

Reply *yes* to move it, or tell me what to change.

current_ig:
Ka m kwado tupu m gbanwee ihe ọ bụla:

• {label}
• Site na: {from}
• Ruo: {to}

Zaa *yes* ka m kwaga ya, ma ọ bụ gwa m ihe m ga-agbanwe.

english:
Just to be sure, because this cannot be undone:

• {label}
• {when}

Reply *yes* to cancel it, or *no* to leave it as it is.

current_ig:
Ka m jide n'aka, n'ihi na enweghị ike ịtụgharị ya:

• {label}
• {when}

Zaa *yes* ka m kagbuo ya, ma ọ bụ *no* ka ọ dịrị ka ọ dị.
